# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE DATABASE  (hosted PostgreSQL)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The API in api/content.js talks to a hosted PostgreSQL database over the
# network. There is no local database file, and none is needed.
#
# On Vercel, the quickest route is Vercel Postgres:
#   1. Vercel dashboard -> Storage -> Create Database
#   2. It creates POSTGRES_URL for you automatically.
#
# Any hosted PostgreSQL works (Neon, Supabase, RDS). Paste its pooled
# connection string here. Never commit real credentials.
#
# POSTGRES_URL is the pooled (serverless-safe) one. Use the NON_POOLING
# url only for running migrations.
# POSTGRES_URL=
# DATABASE_URL=
